<title>UK: C&amp;W has no comment on Sprint bid report.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W has no comment on Sprint bid report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable and Wireless Plc said on Wednesday it had no comment on a Wall Street Journal report it had held talks with Sprint Corp shareholder France Telecom on a possible C&amp;W bid for Sprint.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no comment,&quot; a Cable and Wireless spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The Journal said the discussions were on a possible bid for the 80 percent of Sprint not already owned by France Telecom and Deutsche Telekom, who have 10 percent each.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
